    {
      "local_id": "claim-local-1",
      "text": "地府只有无边的黑暗，黑暗中有透明的魂灵不断从上方渗下、被一个洞口吸进去；孙悟空想深吸气却发现无气可吸，此处没有饥饿、寒冷、痛苦。",
      "certainty": "explicit",
      "attributed_to_candidate_or_ref": null,
      "revealed_at": 11,
      "source_refs": [
        {
          "path": "source/vol-001/ch-000011.txt",
          "chapter_id": "ch-000011",
          "chapter_order": 11,
          "locator": {
            "para_start": 1,
            "para_end": 8
          },
          "anchor": "这里只有无边的黑暗"
        }
      ],
      "basis_refs": [],
      "supersedes_refs": []
    },
    {
      "local_id": "claim-local-2",
      "text": "黑暗深处一只巨大的万足怪把触角伸入万千魂灵之中，将魂灵体内彩色萤火般的小虫抓出来丢入一侧的熔岩之海。",
      "certainty": "explicit",
      "attributed_to_candidate_or_ref": null,
      "revealed_at": 11,
      "source_refs": [
        {
          "path": "source/vol-001/ch-000011.txt",
          "chapter_id": "ch-000011",
          "chapter_order": 11,
          "locator": {
            "para_start": 11,
            "para_end": 12
          },
          "anchor": "一只巨大的万足怪正在将触角伸入万千魂灵之中"
        }
      ],
      "basis_refs": [],
      "supersedes_refs": []
    },
    {
      "local_id": "claim-local-3",
      "text": "被万足怪抓出的那些小虫，据那只形状古怪的发光鬼说，是「欲望」；深渊中的小虫怪叫「让我们走！不要被消灭」。",
      "certainty": "reported",
      "attributed_to_candidate_or_ref": {
        "candidate_name": "引路的鬼（地府解说者）"
      },
      "revealed_at": 11,
      "source_refs": [
        {
          "path": "source/vol-001/ch-000011.txt",
          "chapter_id": "ch-000011",
          "chapter_order": 11,
          "locator": {
            "para_start": 14,
            "para_end": 17
          },
          "anchor": "那是欲望。"
        }
      ],
      "basis_refs": [],
      "supersedes_refs": []
    },
    {
      "local_id": "claim-local-4",
      "text": "引路鬼称：来到这里的魂不仅要放弃欲望，还要放弃记忆——没有欲望就无烦无恼不再痛苦，没有记忆就无牵无挂不再留恋，如此才能洗刷过往、重新开始；转世是为赎罪，还清前世所欠便不必再转世。",
      "certainty": "reported",
      "attributed_to_candidate_or_ref": {
        "candidate_name": "引路的鬼（地府解说者）"
      },
      "revealed_at": 11,
      "source_refs": [
        {
          "path": "source/vol-001/ch-000011.txt",
          "chapter_id": "ch-000011",
          "chapter_order": 11,
          "locator": {
            "para_start": 20,
            "para_end": 26
          },
          "anchor": "不仅是欲望，还有记忆。"
        }
      ],
      "basis_refs": [],
      "supersedes_refs": []
    },
    {
      "local_id": "claim-local-5",
      "text": "引路鬼称：贪怒杀伐都是罪，爱恨痴缠必有相欠，「活着，即是罪孽；有情，就会相欠」。",
      "certainty": "reported",
      "attributed_to_candidate_or_ref": {
        "candidate_name": "引路的鬼（地府解说者）"
      },
      "revealed_at": 11,
      "source_refs": [
        {
          "path": "source/vol-001/ch-000011.txt",
          "chapter_id": "ch-000011",
          "chapter_order": 11,
          "locator": {
            "para_start": 31,
            "para_end": 32
          },
          "anchor": "活着，即是罪孽；有情，就会相欠。"
        }
      ],
      "basis_refs": [],
      "supersedes_refs": []
    },
    {
      "local_id": "claim-local-6",
      "text": "引路鬼称：鬼神靠活物供奉；神从万物灵蕴中吸取能量，世间无活物则神也枯萎消亡；「灵魂是种子，人是庄稼」，神让种子长大、产生欲望去争斗爱恋，人因痛苦而祈求神灵、愿供奉一切，神才成为神，正因人的卑微神才高高在上。",
      "certainty": "reported",
      "attributed_to_candidate_or_ref": {
        "candidate_name": "引路的鬼（地府解说者）"
      },
      "revealed_at": 11,
      "source_refs": [
        {
          "path": "source/vol-001/ch-000011.txt",
          "chapter_id": "ch-000011",
          "chapter_order": 11,
          "locator": {
            "para_start": 35,
            "para_end": 36
          },
          "anchor": "灵魂是种子，人是庄稼"
        }
      ],
      "basis_refs": [],
      "supersedes_refs": []
    },
    {
      "local_id": "claim-local-7",
      "text": "孙悟空据此推问：若没有人神也不复存在，故神的力量并非无法赐予所有人安乐，只是不愿；神故意控制所有人的命运，让人求之不得、痛失所爱，人才会乞求供奉。",
      "certainty": "reported",
      "attributed_to_candidate_or_ref": {
        "path": "characters/char-0002/index.json",
        "record_id": "char-0002"
      },
      "revealed_at": 11,
      "source_refs": [
        {
          "path": "source/vol-001/ch-000011.txt",
          "chapter_id": "ch-000011",
          "chapter_order": 11,
          "locator": {
            "para_start": 38,
            "para_end": 38
          },
          "anchor": "所以神的力量，并非无法赐予所有人安乐，只是不愿。"
        }
      ],
      "basis_refs": [],
      "supersedes_refs": []
    },
    {
      "local_id": "claim-local-8",
      "text": "鬼惊异于孙悟空听完这番话立刻看穿真相并追问他是谁，孙悟空回答「我的名字是孙悟空」，那鬼听后突然不说话。",
      "certainty": "reported",
      "attributed_to_candidate_or_ref": {
